          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ओसरी (osrī) is a tadbhava, a word inherited and reshaped by sound change. It comes from avaśara, \"protection, shelter\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 848). CDIAL compares the sense change in śaraṇa, \"shelter\", toward \"roof, veranda\"."
